---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Sanātana Dharma — Knowledge with context and care"
  description="A bilingual knowledge and devotion platform for exploring Sanātana Dharma with context, sources, and respect."
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Hindi · English · Source-led</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Explore with devotion.<br /><span>Understand with context.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">A thoughtful home for learning about Sanātana Dharma—built to distinguish documented sources, traditional interpretations, and questions that remain open.</p>
      <p class="status-note">The platform foundation is being built. Public articles will appear only after bilingual review and source verification.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="principles" class="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our editorial promise</p>
      <h2 id="principles-title">Respect the tradition. Be honest about evidence.</h2>
      <div class="principle-grid">
        <article><h3>Sources matter</h3><p>Claims should point to identifiable sources. Missing or inaccessible evidence is stated honestly, never filled with guesswork.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Two languages, reviewed</h3><p>Hindi and English are treated as first-class experiences, with review tracked independently for each language.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Care around practice</h3><p>Initiation-restricted mantras and ritual procedures will not be exposed as public how-to content.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="status" class="status-section" aria-labelledby="status-title">
      <h2 id="status-title">Building the foundation</h2>
      <p>This first web spike establishes the static site, accessible layout, and automated build checks. The content repository remains the canonical source; no draft or unverified records are rendered here.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
